WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
A month ago, Zhang Yi went crazy on supplies.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,200
I saw with my own eyes the pharmaceutical company's truck delivering goods to your door

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,400
The two large boxes of goods must all be medicines.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,000
Said he predicted disaster in advance

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
There is a high probability that sufficient amounts of antibiotics are stored

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
This type of medicine is a regular stockpile

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Can't hold it anymore

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Go and ask for Zhang Yi

9
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
We originally planned to leave some supplies for him

10
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,200
I didn't mean to harm him at all

11
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,600
It's because he was too cruel

12
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,060
We are taking advantage of the gift

13
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,860
Zhang Yi pursued you back then

14
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,060
It’s best for you to come forward and ask for medicine.

15
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,260
This matter was originally caused by you.

16
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,860
I'm going to wrong you for the sake of the entire collective.

17
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:33,270
We can only protect you if we survive, okay?

18
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:34,270
I call
